From: Flax Advisors
Subject: sensors: move Current Value column right after Status; add right-border separator

Move the currentValue field from its original position (between lowerCaution
and upperCaution) to immediately follow the Status column.  This groups the
most-important per-sensor data (current reading) visually adjacent to health
status rather than burying it between threshold columns.

Add a black right-hand border to the header and data cells of the
Current Value column so the threshold columns are visually separated
from the primary data.

